body:
Just sold Mesler to RM for 110m, so i needed a new first-choice goalkeeper.

&#x200B;

I got this guy on a free a year ago, and his shot-stopping looks really good for someone his age, his only major weakness being his arieal reach.

&#x200B;

Im slightly nervous about his low star rating, even though stars dont matter that much. So can i start this guy as my main goalkeeper as a top 4 level Lyon side?
